\label{def:closure-deficit}
Given a packaging $\Pi : \mathcal{X}\to\mathcal{Y}$ and a staging scale $\tau$, the \emph{micro-closure deficit} is
\begin{equation}
\mathsf{CD}_\tau(\Pi)
:=
I(X_t; Y_{t+\tau} \mid Y_t).
\label{eq:closure-deficit}
\end{equation}

